<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army is pushing forward in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile while the Rapid Support Forces and allied SPLM-N claim capture of multiple new locations in the Blue Nile, including five additional areas in southeast Sudan and sites such as Al-Madina 12 and Dering. RSF-linked groups have been accused of killing three children and other civilians in West Kordofan, and a drone strike on a shelter in West Kordofan killed 16 people and injured 10. The Tasis Alliance seized the strategic Bau district in the Blue Nile, and Burhan reassured residents of Ed Damazin as RSF forces closed in. The conflict has caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/21/sudans-elderly-face-hardship-and-heartbreak-in-a-life-of-displacement?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxONWNTSjRWTkpuQ0hnWEZtb3hDVWEyZFkwU0gtZFg5SWJvNDNkWl9taF81dU1GbVd4TDI3Z0R3N1NVZHI0S1hGeTJZS2JxblJfTlZ3czR2RVI0c1lTR01nUGE1T2hoR2tvdWRaeUZ4X1VyN1QxeWZrbXRzODRfTzk1NlQ5NHVrcUdWMEk0Znl6a0xOTTJYVDNLM1hDSG5uVXhaRUM4MQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQemNHWDV6ZlRZS0pBb3djbVRjMjFtci1sZ1VsSS0ySThHQUVlN2dHSmVCenZkd0xPWnJTUFowUldsckFzR2lBUzNCd0ladGg0bWZKQVBiMWpwNXJZc0hsZXRfekJDT2k1aXdSVzJockgzTHplRWlUcDNfRGRCakdqOG5tVW05TzJTOGxIRnd0YThqQXFaVzQ1ckE4TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1tRVJHWDhYZlpkVzk5QlFibjdNWWhNSVBLblR1OVpHRTNCb0Zwb2V6aWdwcGJOQTgxQXR6dUc1OXNxWjNQNkxRN0JFZUNFdUI1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;,